B.ZJ=new A.a3("AI features","AI explanations can be wrong or incomplete. Do not rely on them for important decisions. Plans and tips are suggestions only.")
B.Zu=new A.a3("Acceptable use","Do not misuse the service: no attempts to break, overload or reverse engineer it, no unlawful content, and no sharing of your account.")
