B.oI={procrastination:0,focus:1,goals:2,worktime:3,phone:4,maintask:5,latestart:6,sleep:7,breaks:8,lost:9,perfect:10,noplan:11,streak:12,inconsistent:13,nit_tidy:14,nit_water:15,nit_tabs:16}
B.Tl=s(["Start with a two-minute version of the task. Starting is the whole battle.","Pick one task and give yourself 10 minutes. You can stop after that, you will not."],t.s)
B.PM=s(["Work in 25-minute blocks with the phone in another room, then take 5 minutes off.","Pick one tab, one task and one timer. When it rings, take a real break."],t.s)
B.RC=s(["Before you start, ask: does this move my main goal? If not, it goes after the one that does.","Write your top goal where you can see it and do one thing for it first thing."],t.s)
B.PF=s(["Block one 45-minute slot for real work at a fixed time each day. Protect it like a meeting.","Aim for just 30 minutes more tomorrow. Small, boring and it adds up."],t.s)
B.SX=s(["Put your phone in another room for your next work block. Out of sight really works.","Turn off notifications for social apps while you work. Check them at set times."],t.s)
B.Qs=s(["Name your one most important task before bed, and do it before anything else tomorrow.","Break your main task into the first tiny step. Do just that step, then see how you feel."],t.s)
B.Q7=s(["Set a start time and a first action the night before. Make it so easy you cannot say no.","Start before 11 AM, even for 15 minutes. The rest of the day gets easier."],t.s)
B.Rx=s(["Pick a fixed bedtime and stop screens 30 minutes before. It is the cheapest productivity upgrade.","Move bedtime 20 minutes earlier tonight. Tiny change, big difference."],t.s)
B.RP=s(["Take a real 5-minute break away from screens every hour. Walk, stretch, drink water.","Set a break timer. Breaks are part of the work, not a reward for it."],t.s)
B.T3=s(['When you notice you drifted, say "back" out loud and return to the exact last line you wrote.','Keep a "later" list for random thoughts so they do not steal your time.'],t.s)
B.PH=s(["Make a bad first draft on purpose. Fixing something beats staring at nothing.","Set a timer and decide that done in 20 minutes beats perfect next week."],t.s)
B.RO=s(["Spend 3 minutes tonight writing tomorrow's top 3 tasks and the first step of each.","Plan your first work block by the hour. Decide what you will do before you sit down."],t.s)
B.Sw=s(["Check in at the same time every day, right after something you already do, like dinner.","Keep it tiny: a 2-minute check-in is enough to keep the streak alive."],t.s)
B.QX=s(["Set a daily reminder and tie your check-in to a habit you already have.","Aim for 4 check-ins this week. Not seven, just four."],t.s)
B.T_=s(["Keep doing what you are doing. Maybe wash the mugs."],t.s)
B.S4=s(["Keep a full water bottle on your desk and refill it at every break."],t.s)
B.RB=s(["Close every tab you have not touched this week. Future you will thank you."],t.s)
B.Vp=new A.ba(B.oI,[B.Tl,B.PM,B.RC,B.PF,B.SX,B.Qs,B.Q7,B.Rx,B.RP,B.T3,B.PH,B.RO,B.Sw,B.QX,B.T_,B.S4,B.RB],t.VJ)
B.bf=new A.nz(0,"mild")
B.ba=new A.nz(1,"medium")
B.bg=new A.nz(2,"savage")
B.QU=s(["You put things off {delay} before starting. Adorable. The task is still waiting for you.","Starting is clearly your hardest task. Your to-do list has noticed."],t.s)
B.S9=s(["You wait {delay} before you start anything. Procrastination is not a habit for you, it is a hobby with a training plan.","The task is not hard. You just take {delay} to say hello to it. That is a long hello."],t.s)
B.T6=s(["You delay {delay} before every task. At this rate your future self needs a lawyer.","You do not start things, you hold a long ceremony first. {delay} of it. The task has aged."],t.s)
B.VZ=new A.bR([B.bf,B.QU,B.ba,B.S9,B.bg,B.T6],t.F)
B.RZ=s(["You can focus for {stretch} before something wins you back. Cute little sprint.","Your attention span is on a coffee break and has not told you."],t.s)
B.PG=s(["You focus for {stretch}, then you vanish. A goldfish would ask you to try harder.","Your focus lasts {stretch}. Your excuses last all afternoon."],t.s)
B.Rw=s(["Your focus lasts {stretch}. A mayfly would call that disrespectful.","You focus for {stretch} and call it a session. That is a sneeze with a timer."],t.s)
B.VK=new A.bR([B.bf,B.RZ,B.ba,B.PG,B.bg,B.Rw],t.F)
B.Q9=s(["You stay busy, but your work barely moves your goal. Lots of steps, wrong staircase.","You are working hard. Just not on the thing you said you wanted."],t.s)
B.PL=s(["Your work keeps missing your goal. You are the proof that being busy is not the same as getting anywhere.","Your goal called. It asked what you have been doing all week."],t.s)
B.Sv=s(["You are so busy going nowhere that your goal sent a search party.","Your effort and your goal are not in a relationship. They have not even met."],t.s)
B.VM=new A.bR([B.bf,B.Q9,B.ba,B.PL,B.bg,B.Sv],t.F)
B.T1=s(["The hours of real work you logged would fit on a sticky note.","You work in tiny bursts. Very efficient, if the goal was a snack."],t.s)
B.SV=s(["You log so little real work that it counts as a rumor.","Your work time is a part-time job and you are not even enjoying the benefits."],t.s)
B.QI=s(["The amount of work you did could be rounded to a hobby, and not a serious one.","Your productive hours are so rare they should be tagged like endangered animals."],t.s)
B.VL=new A.bR([B.bf,B.T1,B.ba,B.SV,B.bg,B.QI],t.F)
B.Tv=s(["Your phone pulled you away on {n} of {days} days. It really likes you.","You and your phone are inseparable. Your work would like a turn."],t.s)
B.Su=s(["Your phone beat your work on {n} of {days} days. It does not even try that hard.","Your phone has a better attendance record than you do."],t.s)
B.SI=s(["Your phone won {n} out of {days} days. It is your real manager and it pays you in notifications.","You do not use your phone. Your phone uses you, and honestly it is winning."],t.s)
B.VR=new A.bR([B.bf,B.Tv,B.ba,B.Su,B.bg,B.SI],t.F)
B.SR=s(["You did not fully finish your most important task on {n} of {days} days. It is patient.","Your most important task is still sitting there, politely waiting."],t.s)
B.Tr=s(["Your most important task was not done on {n} of {days} days. Important is clearly a loose word for you.","You skipped your top task {n} times out of {days}. It is starting to take it personally."],t.s)
B.S0=s(["You dodged your most important task {n} of {days} days. It is not the task that is the problem, it is the dodging.","Your number one task has been waiting so long it is applying for another owner."],t.s)
B.VS=new A.bR([B.bf,B.SR,B.ba,B.Tr,B.bg,B.S0],t.F)
B.Rt=s(["You started your main task late on {n} of {days} days. Dramatic entrance every time.","Your best work seems to begin when the sun is already tired."],t.s)
B.Ty=s(["You start late on {n} of {days} days and then act surprised that the day is short.","You start work when the sun is leaving. Nothing is wrong with the sun."],t.s)
B.Tq=s(["You start so late that the task is practically a night shift with no overtime pay.","Late starts on {n} of {days} days. You are not behind schedule, you are in a different timezone from your goals."],t.s)
B.VP=new A.bR([B.bf,B.Rt,B.ba,B.Ty,B.bg,B.Tq],t.F)
B.SJ=s(["You skipped good sleep on {n} of {days} days. Sleep is free, you know.","Your sleep is on the same list as your tasks: unfinished."],t.s)
B.RG=s(["You ran on fumes on {n} of {days} days and called it a personality.","Sleep is the only task you consistently skip that actually helps every other one."],t.s)
B.SQ=s(["You skipped sleep on {n} of {days} days. Your brain is running on hope and a loading bar.","You treat sleep like an optional DLC. The game keeps crashing."],t.s)
B.VT=new A.bR([B.bf,B.SJ,B.ba,B.RG,B.bg,B.SQ],t.F)
B.R7=s(["You never take a break. Not even a small one. Brave.","Zero breaks. Your chair is concerned."],t.s)
B.Qy=s(["No breaks at all. You are not a machine, and even machines get maintenance.","You skip breaks, then your brain takes one for you without asking."],t.s)
B.Px=s(["No breaks, ever. Your brain takes them anyway, unannounced, in the middle of your best idea.","You never rest, which is why you are always tired. Impressive logic."],t.s)
B.VN=new A.bR([B.bf,B.R7,B.ba,B.Qy,B.bg,B.Px],t.F)
B.R_=s(["You lose about {mins} minutes a day to drifting. Tiny leaks sink big plans.","About {mins} minutes a day vanish and nobody is quite sure where."],t.s)
B.SE=s(["About {mins} minutes a day just disappear. Somewhere there is a pile of your time with a nice view.","{mins} minutes a day gone. At that rate you donate hours to the void every week."],t.s)
B.R3=s(["You lose about {mins} minutes a day to nothing. Nothing is very successful with your time.","{mins} minutes a day, every day, handed over to the void. The void did not even ask."],t.s)
B.VU=new A.bR([B.bf,B.R_,B.ba,B.SE,B.bg,B.R3],t.F)
B.SN=s(["You wait until it can be perfect, so it never starts. Classic.","Perfect is the plan. Done is not invited."],t.s)
B.Qp=s(["You want it perfect before you begin. Nothing has been perfect and also nothing has been started.","Perfectionism is just procrastination wearing a nice outfit."],t.s)
B.QQ=s(["You will not start until it can be perfect. So the masterpiece is currently a blank page and a lot of opinions.","Your standards are so high that nothing can reach them, including you."],t.s)
B.VY=new A.bR([B.bf,B.SN,B.ba,B.Qp,B.bg,B.QQ],t.F)
B.Sb=s(["You often did not know where to start. Hint: it is usually step one.","Your plan for the day is vibes. Bold."],t.s)
B.Rv=s(["You said you had no plan. That is a plan. It is just a bad one.","Your day has no structure, so your day structured you."],t.s)
B.PI=s(["No plan again. You are drifting like a shopping cart in a parking lot.","Your plan is to improvise. The universe has read it and left you on read."],t.s)
B.VQ=new A.bR([B.bf,B.Sb,B.ba,B.Rv,B.bg,B.PI],t.F)
B.R1=s(["Your streak is {streak}. Everyone starts somewhere. Some start tomorrow.","A {streak}-day streak. It is a nice, small, fragile baby streak."],t.s)
B.Ta=s(["Your streak is {streak}. A houseplant you forgot to water has a better commitment record.","That {streak}-day streak lasts about as long as a New Year resolution."],t.s)
B.Ry=s(["A {streak}-day streak. Your commitment has the shelf life of a banana.","Your streak is {streak}. You have more browser tabs open than days in a row."],t.s)
B.VO=new A.bR([B.bf,B.R1,B.ba,B.Ta,B.bg,B.Ry],t.F)
B.QV=s(["You checked in {days} times in a week. A cameo appearance.","You only show up now and then. We have noticed, and we still like you."],t.s)
B.Tt=s(["You checked in {days} times this week. That is not a habit, that is a drop-in.","Your attendance is a guest star, not a series regular."],t.s)
B.RY=s(["Only {days} check-ins this week. Even your gym membership has a better turnout.","You ghost your own habits. That takes real talent."],t.s)
B.W_=new A.bR([B.bf,B.QV,B.ba,B.Tt,B.bg,B.RY],t.F)
B.SC=s(["Honestly your habits look decent. I will have to nitpick: your desk probably has one too many mugs."],t.s)
B.Tf=s(["I came to roast you and you are doing fine. Infuriating. Your desk is probably a museum of old mugs though."],t.s)
B.T5=s(["I tried to find something to roast and you made it hard. Fine: your desk is a mug graveyard and you know it."],t.s)
B.W0=new A.bR([B.bf,B.SC,B.ba,B.Tf,B.bg,B.T5],t.F)
B.Rl=s(["Not much to roast. Maybe drink more water, you have the energy of a houseplant on a bad day."],t.s)
B.QT=s(["You are annoyingly consistent. I will take what I can get: when did you last drink water?"],t.s)
B.Pw=s(["You give me almost nothing. So: your water bottle has probably been empty since last week."],t.s)
B.VV=new A.bR([B.bf,B.Rl,B.ba,B.QT,B.bg,B.Pw],t.F)
B.RW=s(["You are doing well. The only thing I can roast is your browser tabs, which I am sure are in the hundreds."],t.s)
B.R0=s(["Genuinely hard to roast you. Your browser tabs, however, are a cry for help."],t.s)
B.QR=s(["Fine, you win. I will roast your 47 open tabs, because nobody has 47 tabs and a clear mind."],t.s)
B.VX=new A.bR([B.bf,B.RW,B.ba,B.R0,B.bg,B.QR],t.F)
