B.oA=new A.ba(B.Ac,["Today","Plan","Progress","Challenges","Profile","Next","Back","Optional","Skip","Close","Continue","Good morning","Good afternoon","Good evening","Today's score","No check-in yet","Start today's check-in","Answer a few questions about your day to receive your score out of 100.","Yesterday you scored {n}. Complete today's check-in to compare.","Aim to beat {n} tomorrow.","View breakdown and guidance","Edit check-in","Daily breakdown","Last check-in \xb7 {date}","Complete a check-in to see your breakdown.","Main task","{n}-day streak","Morning","Midday","Evening","morning","midday","evening","Wrap-up","Make it yours","Pick your colours and light or dark mode. The app changes right away.","Colour palette","Mode","Dark","Light","Match my device","How should the AI help?","These are the same switches as in Settings. You can change them any time.","AI analysis","Explains your score and writes your plans. It never decides the score. Off means basic guidance only.","Share my written answers with the AI","Lets plans mention your real tasks and goals. Off means the AI only sees scores and choices.","Which day should your weekly report arrive?","Each week you get a report on your average score, biggest improvement and what to work on next. You can change the day in Settings.","Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday","Saturday","Sunday","Time for your check-in","Rate your day, {name}, and keep your streak going.","Choose your language","You can change this at any time in Settings.","Which best describes you?","This helps us set sensible defaults.","High school student","College or university student","Graduate student","Working professional","Something else","What is your main goal right now?","Be specific. For example: raise my GPA to 3.8, finish my portfolio, or pass the SAT in March. You can add more goals below.","Write your goal in a sentence","Add a second goal","Add a less important goal","Add a long-term goal","Second goal","Less important goal","Long-term goal","Another goal you are working toward","Something worth doing, but not a priority","Where you want to be in a year or more","Remove","What takes up most of your working time?","List the subjects, projects or jobs you split your time across.","For example: Calculus, essay drafts, part-time job","How many hours of focused work make a strong day for you?","This becomes your daily target.","1 hour","2 hours","3 hours","4 hours","5 or more hours","When do you usually do your best work?","We will compare this with what your check-ins show.","It varies","What gets in your way most often?","Select all that apply.","Phone and social media","Procrastination","Low energy or tiredness","Unclear priorities","Distractions at home","Taking on too much","Staying consistent","What time do you usually wake up?","Your check-in is organised around your day.","Before 6 AM","6 to 7 AM","7 to 8 AM","8 to 9 AM","After 9 AM","How would you rate your current productivity habits?","There is no wrong answer. This is your starting point.","Very inconsistent","Very consistent","Which one habit would you most like to build?","One habit is enough to start.","For example: start homework before dinner","When should we remind you to check in?","A reminder at the same time each day builds the habit fastest.","No reminder","Your profile is ready, {name}.","Here is what we will work with. You can change any of this later in Settings.","Main goal","Daily focus target","Reminder","Finish setup","How old are you?","We use this to tailor examples and targets. It is not shared.","Under 16","16 to 18","19 to 22","23 to 29","30 or older","Write a short bio","One or two sentences about who you are and what you are working toward. It appears on your profile.","For example: Second-year biology student balancing classes and a part-time job.","Where do you want to be one year from now?","Describe the outcome you are working toward over the long term.","For example: Accepted into a nursing program with a 3.8 GPA","How many hours do you usually sleep?","Sleep strongly affects focus, so we track it alongside your score.","Fewer than 5 hours","5 to 6 hours","6 to 7 hours","7 to 8 hours","More than 8 hours","How do you usually plan your day?","Choose the option that fits best.","A written to-do list","Time blocks in a calendar","I keep it in my head","I do not plan ahead","Where is your phone while you work?","Phone habits are one of the biggest influences on focus.","Within reach with notifications on","Within reach, silenced","In another room","I use an app blocker","Which areas do you most want to improve?","Select up to three.","Staying focused","Starting on time","Consistency","Using time well","Sleep and energy","Balance with free time","Drag to choose a time, or turn reminders off.","Bio","Your productivity profile",u.fC,"Building your profile","Analyzing your habits and goals","Upgrade to unlock your summary and score",u.gL,"Upgrade to unlock","Unlock my results","Starting estimate",u.u,"Summary",u.dk,u.r,u.a6,u.f1,u.ax,"Priority areas: {areas}.","Step {n} of {total}","{period} check-in","What did you work on this {period}?","Name the tasks briefly. Leave this blank if you did not work during this time.","For example: chemistry problem set, emails, gym session","Your check-in covers the parts of the day that have already happened.","Skip this part of the day","Skipped","How long did you wait before starting your first task this {period}?","Procrastination","I started right away","About 15 minutes","About 30 minutes","About an hour","Most of the {period}","What was your longest stretch on a single task without checking your phone?","Focus","I didn't use my phone","Under 5 minutes","5 to 15 minutes","15 to 30 minutes","30 to 60 minutes","More than an hour","How much time did you spend on productive work this {period}?","Total time","None","Under 30 minutes","30 to 60 minutes","1 to 2 hours","More than 2 hours","How much did your work this {period} move you toward your goal?","Your goal: {goal}",'How much did your work this {period} move you toward "{goal}"?','How directly did today\'s work connect to "{goal}"?','Did you take a concrete step toward "{goal}" today?',"Closeness to your goals","Not at all","Slightly","Moderately","Significantly","It was directly on target","What was the single most important thing to get done today?","Name one task. We will ask you about it next.","For example: finish the lab report introduction","Start my 5-day free trial","Free trial \xb7 day {n} of {total}","LAST DAY","Check in every day to keep your streak. When day 5 is done, your 5-day review is ready for you.","Last day of your free trial. Tomorrow your 5-day review is ready, and you will need to subscribe to open it.","Your free trial is over","Your 5-day review is ready","We wrote it from everything you told us this week. Subscribe to unlock it and keep going.","You did not check in during your trial. Subscribe to start your first review.","check-ins","longest streak","Your 5-day review","average score","Best day","Unlock my review","Your data stays saved. Nothing is deleted.","About {n} minutes. A short one to start; it grows a little each day.","About {n} minutes today","Did you finish your most important task today?","How would you rate the quality of your work on your most important task?","Did you finish your most important task when you planned to?","Is your most important task on schedule?","When did you start your most important task?",'Did you complete "{task}"?',"Yes, completely","Partially","No",'When did you start working on "{task}"?',"Start time is one of the strongest patterns we track.","Before 11 AM","11 AM to 2 PM","2 to 6 PM","After 6 PM","I did not start it","What got in the way?","One or two sentences is enough.","For example: I kept checking messages and lost the first hour","What else did you accomplish today?","Select what applies or add your own.","Add another accomplishment","Which of these did you take care of today?","Select all that apply.","Slept enough","Exercised","Ate proper meals","Took breaks","Had personal time",'How would you rate the quality of your work on "{task}"?',"Be honest. This changes your main-task score.","Excellent, I would hand it in as it is","Good, with minor improvements possible","Acceptable, but rushed in places","Weak, it needs significant rework",'Did you finish "{task}" when you planned to?',"Yes, on time or early","Slightly later than planned","Much later than planned",'Is "{task}" on schedule?',"On track to finish when planned","Slightly behind","Far behind","Drag the slider to set your mood.","How would you describe your overall mood today?","Drained","Low","Neutral","Good","Excellent","What is one thing you would do differently tomorrow?","A short note helps you act on it.","For example: start the hardest task before opening social media","Main task","Procrastination","Follow-up","What pulled you away from your work today?","Select all that apply.","My phone","Social media","Videos or streaming","Messages and chats","Games","Random web browsing","People around me","Chores and errands","Snacking or food","Feeling tired","Nothing pulled me away","When you delayed or drifted, what was the main reason?","Pick the closest one. Knowing the trigger is half the fix.","The task felt boring","The task felt hard","I was not sure where to start","I was tired or low on energy","I felt anxious or overwhelmed","I wanted it to be perfect first","I had no plan for that time","I did not delay or drift","When you noticed you were off task, what did you do?","Went straight back to work","Took a short break, then returned","It took me a long time to get back","I gave up on it for a while","I did not notice or did not drift","About how much time did distractions cost you today?","A rough guess is fine.","Almost none","About 10 minutes","About 20 minutes","About 45 minutes","An hour or more","An extra question based on your day. Optional: answer in your own words or pick a quick answer.","Type your own answer","Thinking of a few more questions","How often did you switch between tasks while working?","Almost never","A few times","About once an hour","Every few minutes","Constantly","How free from distractions was the place you worked in?","Silent and clear","Quiet, minor noise","Some interruptions","Often interrupted","Chaotic","How deeply were you absorbed in your best work session?","Completely absorbed","Mostly absorbed","Somewhat","Barely","Not at all","How directly did today's work connect to your main goal?","Directly","Mostly","Partly","Barely","Not at all","Did you take a concrete step on a longer-term goal today?","A big step","A small step","I only thought about it","No","I have no long-term goal yet","How clear were you about what progress looked like today?","Crystal clear","Fairly clear","Vague","Unclear","No idea","How well did you stick to the plan you made for the day?","Exactly","Mostly","About half","Barely","I had no plan","How much of your day was taken by things you did not plan?","Almost nothing","About an hour","About two hours","Half the day","Most of the day","How much of your work time was deep work rather than admin or email?","Nearly all","More than half","About half","Less than half","Almost none","How was your energy through the day?","High all day","Mostly good","Up and down","Low most of the day","Exhausted","How stressed did you feel?","Calm","Slightly tense","Moderately stressed","Very stressed","Overwhelmed","How well did you sleep last night?","Great","Good","Okay","Poor","Barely slept","Something else? Say it in your own words.","Type anything that is not on the list (optional)","Step {n} of {total}","Next","Finish","Skip tour","Skip this step","Try it yourself to continue","Welcome to Daytovi","This tour uses the real app. You will tap things yourself, and you will start your first check-in. It takes about two minutes.","This is your score card","Each day you get one score out of 100 here, with the reason behind it. It is empty for now because you have not checked in yet.","Start your first check-in","Tap the button, answer the first question, then close the check-in with the X to come back. Your answers are saved as a draft, so you can finish it later.","Open the Plan tab","Tap Plan. Every check-in adds things to do here, soon and over the coming weeks.","Add your own to-do","Type something you want to do and press Add. Your plan mixes ideas from your check-ins with your own tasks. You can skip this one.","Open Progress","Tap Progress to see how you are doing over time.","Your weekly report","A report on your week arrives on the day you chose (Sunday unless you changed it), with your average score, your biggest improvement and what to work on next.","Open Profile","Tap Profile for your settings, goals and data.","Make it yours","Here you can pick colours and a language, set your daily reminder and report day, switch the doodles on or off, and replay this tour any time.","Skip","Next","Back","Let's go","Welcome to Daytovi","Daytovi turns a few honest answers about your day into a score out of 100, shows what held you back, and gives you one thing to change tomorrow. This quick tour shows you around.","Check in once a day",'Tap "Start today\'s check-in" on the Today tab. You answer one question at a time about your morning, midday and evening. Tired of typing? Tap the microphone in any answer box and just talk.',"Your score and summary","Your score comes from a fixed formula plus a small random nudge of up to 3 points, and nothing ever reads 0. After each check-in you see four tabs: your score, a short-term plan, a long-term plan and a deep dive. Look through all four to finish.","The Plan tab","Every check-in adds items to your Plan: things to do soon and habits to build over weeks. Tick them off, add your own, and remove what you do not want.","Streaks, XP and challenges","Check in every day to grow your streak and earn XP. Pop-ups show your rewards: swipe one sideways to dismiss it. Challenges and achievements give you extra goals.","Progress and your goals","The Progress tab shows your trends and weekly report. Your goals appear in your check-in questions, and Daytovi asks every two weeks if they are still right. You can change them any time in Profile.","Make it yours","In Profile you can pick a colour palette, switch language, set a reminder, download your data or delete it. You can replay this tour there whenever you like.","Calculate my score","Calculating your score","Your check-in could not be saved. Please try again.","Your detailed analysis allowance for today has been used, so standard guidance is shown.","Forgot your password?","If an account exists for that email, a reset link is on its way."],t.l)
