B.YH=new A.cc("Day 5","Note how long you waited before starting each day. The wait should be shrinking.","A shrinking delay is the clearest sign of progress.")
B.YI=new A.cc("Day 5","Do two 45-minute blocks in one day and record how focused you felt.","Two real blocks is a strong day.")
B.YJ=new A.cc("Day 2","Use the two-minute rule: begin the task for just two minutes, then decide whether to stop.","Starting small removes the resistance.")
